cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NuReg-XDoc in your research, please cite the dataset and the accompanying paper."
type: dataset
title: "NuReg-XDoc: A Cross-Doctype Regulatory QA Benchmark with Document-Grounded Reasoning Paths for KG-Augmented RAG"
abstract: >-
  NuReg-XDoc is a benchmark for cross-document, cross-doctype reasoning
  over the U.S. nuclear regulatory hierarchy. It pairs a corpus of
  regulatory PDFs spanning multiple doctypes with a typed inter-document
  reference graph and 938 review queries derived from NRC RAI documents,
  each annotated with document-prescribed evidence chains. The dataset
  enables path- and order-aware retrieval metrics such as Path Recall@k
  and Ordered Prefix Recall.
